# 14. The countdown: the master is the car record's $20FB6A (1/30 s; decremented at $DECA, extended at
#     $DEB2 at checkpoints); $209012 is a copy. Holding $209012 does not stop the countdown (game over at
#     the end of the first stage, frame ~10000); holding $20FB6A does.
include race_mp.inc
2600-9000 w16 $20fb6a 1200
2600-9000 w16 $209038 0
3000 aset ANALOG1 ff 96
4000 p16 $209012 $20fb6a $208080
9000 p16 $209012 $20fb6a $208080 $20040c
9000 snap e14_9000.png
9000 exit
